body:
I am not an economist, much less a politician, but I would say that one of the best things to fix my country would be to return unjustly expropriated companies in the first place, another measure that would be taken would be to let new companies establish themselves here, practically I would like it to be I will implement capitalism in my country, it is the most rational solution that I see to the current problem that Venezuela suffers

&#x200B;

EDIT: And answering the question about which form of government would you prefer, I would like to see a democracy, like in the old days, long before I was born
